Cell["\<\
i want you to look at the 18 stable scales of toroidal closure or dimensional \
stability ,,, lets refine the logic and variables as well as their \
computation potentials and uses as much as absolutely possible the goal is to \
use all of the most functional methods possible ,,  and so we can create 18 \
SUPER RIGOROUS AND ROBUS ACCURATE COMLPETE TESTS FOR THIS NOTEBOOK  I HAVE \
PROVIDED MORE CONTEXT IN THIS NOTEBOOK , CAN YOU GENERATE .TS COMPUTATIONAL \
FILES PLEASE ,, I WANT US TO PLAN THE MOST ABSOLUTE AND COMPLETE \
COMPUTATIONAL FRAMEWORK (THIS CAN BE TOWARDS WHATS MATHEMATICALLY POSSIBLE \
AND PERFECT IN COMPUTATION AND FUNCTIONAL INFORAMTION ANALYSIS AND ALGORITHMS \
, NEW WAYS OF BITMAPPING AND GEMATRIA THAT CAN FUNCIOTN IN RESONANCE WITH \
THIS ENGINE ... PLEASE CAREFULLY DO THIS SLOWLY , ACCURATELY , DEEPLY , LETS \
PLAN AND STRUCTURE THE FULL FRAMEWORK FOR THE SMALLEST STABLE DIMESNIONAL \
FRAMEWORK OF SPAVCETIME AND ALL POTENTIAOLLY RELATED FUNCTIONAL ALGORITHMS , \
PLEASE IGNORE MY SPELLING ERRORS . MAD GENIUS MODE ACTIVE\
\>", "ChatInput",
