thresholds as physical or epistemic constraints"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"36de4b52-7ae7-f44f-96ae-92b1ce223f42"],
 "\nThese must be converted into ",
 StyleBox["explicit mathematical objects",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ".\n\nSo the correct move is:\n\n1. define a ",
 StyleBox["minimal ontology",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n2. define ",
 StyleBox["state variables",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n3. define ",
 StyleBox["derived invariants",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n4. define ",
 StyleBox["operators",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n5. define ",
 StyleBox["18 tests",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n6. define ",
 StyleBox["implementation layers",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n7. define ",
 StyleBox["TypeScript export schema",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n8. define ",
 StyleBox["verification protocol",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
