  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"65f52c45-87cc-2e45-901b-33da1b47abf9"],
 "\nThis is where the real physics / logic begins.\n\nWe need invariants that \
are: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "dimensionless where possible"
