 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"XIII. Concrete refinement proposal for the 18 scales\"\>", 
    "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"2440f0d6-5066-8b4e-a42f-1b70fdc62fa5"],
 "\nTo avoid vagueness, I suggest naming the 18 scales provisionally as:\n\n\
1. Null boundary seed\n2. Proto-closure\n3. Minimal loop coherence\n4. First \
toroidal lock\n5. Curvature capture\n6. Torsion stabilization\n7. Flux \
containment\n8. Boundary reciprocity\n9. Information-density locking\n10. \
Complexity-resolution balance\n11. Resonant shell formation\n12. Cross-scale \
coupling onset\n13. Recursive closure stabilization\n14. Measurement \
admissibility\n15. Eigenmode neutrality\n16. Harmonic persistence\n17. \
Corridor-certified autonomy\n18. Full dimensional stability\n\nThese are \
placeholders, but they create a progression. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
