                    FrameBox["\<\"# RHUFT Scale Hierarchy Visual Evaluation \
Framework\\n\\nThis notebook provides a **full visual, configurable \
evaluation system** for the RHUFT scale hierarchy over the stable toroidal \
closure scales\\n\\n$$n \\\\in \
\\\\{0,13,20,40,60,80,100,120,140,160,180,186,200,220,240,260,280,292\\\\}.$$\
\\n\\nIt replaces weak placeholder tests with a more rigorous computational \
framework centered on:\\n\\n1. **explicit scale parameterization**\\n2. \
**derived invariants**\\n3. **visual diagnostics**\\n4. **interactive \
slider-based exploration**\\n5. **configurable threshold logic**\\n6. \
**export-ready data structures**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Core constants and \
stable scales\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[goldenRatio, stableScales, planckLength, \
planckTime, lightSpeed];\\n\\ngoldenRatio = N[(1 + Sqrt[5])/2, \
80];\\nplanckLength = Quantity[1.616255*10^-35, \\\"Meters\\\"];\\nplanckTime \
= Quantity[5.391247*10^-44, \\\"Seconds\\\"];\\nlightSpeed = \
Quantity[299792458, \\\"Meters\\\"/\\\"Seconds\\\"];\\n\\nstableScales = {0, \
13, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100, 120, 140, 160, 180, 186, 200, 220, 240, 260, 280, \
292};\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. RHUFT parameter model\\n\\nThis section \
implements the chapter definitions in a computationally consistent \
form.\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[\\n  lengthScale, timeQuantum, spatialResolution, \
complexityMeasure,\\n  informationDensityRatio, stabilityScore, \
windingNumber,\\n  kappaConst, lambdaConst, infoCoupling, gradientCoupling, \
waveSpeedRatio,\\n  scaleAssociation\\n];\\n\\nkappaConst = 1/(goldenRatio \
Pi);\\nlambdaConst = 1/goldenRatio^2;\\n\\nlengthScale[n_] := \
planckLength*goldenRatio^n;\\n\\ntimeQuantum[n_, epsilon_: 0] := \
planckTime*goldenRatio^n*(1 + epsilon n);\\n\\nspatialResolution[n_] := \
planckLength*goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\ncomplexityMeasure[n_] := 3 n \
Log[goldenRatio];\\n\\ninformationDensityRatio[n_] := \
goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\nstabilityScore[n_] := Module[{x = goldenRatio^n/13}, 1 - \
Abs[x - Round[x]]/x];\\n\\nwindingNumber[n_] := \
Round[goldenRatio^n/13];\\n\\ninfoCoupling[n_, hbar_: 1, c_: 1] := (hbar/c^2) \
goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\ngradientCoupling[n_, mass_: 1, hbar_: 1, c_: 1] := \
(hbar/(mass c^2)) goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\nwaveSpeedRatio[n_, epsilon_: 0, rho0_: \
1, kappa_: kappaConst] := Module[\\n  {\\n    rho = rho0 \
informationDensityRatio[n],\\n    tau = goldenRatio^n (1 + epsilon n)\\n  \
},\\n  1/(Sqrt[rho kappa] tau)\\n];\\n\\nscaleAssociation[n_, opts : \
OptionsPattern[{\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n    \
\\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n \
   \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99\\n  }]] := Module[\\n  {\\n    epsilon \
= OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n    rho0 = OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n    \
mass = OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n    hbar = OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\"],\\n  \
  c = OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    threshold = \
OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"],\\n    score\\n  },\\n  score = \
stabilityScore[n];\\n  <|\\n    \\\"Scale\\\" -> n,\\n    \\\"LengthScale\\\" \
-> lengthScale[n],\\n    \\\"TimeQuantum\\\" -> timeQuantum[n, epsilon],\\n   \
 \\\"SpatialResolution\\\" -> spatialResolution[n],\\n    \\\"Complexity\\\" \
-> complexityMeasure[n],\\n    \\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\" -> \
informationDensityRatio[n],\\n    \\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\" -> waveSpeedRatio[n, \
epsilon, rho0],\\n    \\\"InfoCoupling\\\" -> infoCoupling[n, hbar, c],\\n    \
\\\"GradientCoupling\\\" -> gradientCoupling[n, mass, hbar, c],\\n    \
\\\"Kappa\\\" -> kappaConst,\\n    \\\"Lambda\\\" -> lambdaConst,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityScore\\\" -> score,\\n    \\\"WindingNumber\\\" -> \
windingNumber[n],\\n    \\\"StableQ\\\" -> score >= threshold\\n  \
|>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Realm \
labels\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[realmName];\\n\\nrealmName = Association[\\n  0 \
-> \\\"Planck Foam\\\",\\n  13 -> \\\"Quark Core\\\",\\n  20 -> \
\\\"QGP\\\",\\n  40 -> \\\"Muon/Pion\\\",\\n  60 -> \
\\\"Proton/Neutron\\\",\\n  80 -> \\\"Atom Core\\\",\\n  100 -> \\\"Bohr Atom\
\\\",\\n  120 -> \\\"Molecule\\\",\\n  140 -> \\\"DNA\\\",\\n  160 -> \
\\\"Organelle\\\",\\n  180 -> \\\"Cell\\\",\\n  186 -> \\\"Neural\\\",\\n  \
200 -> \\\"Human\\\",\\n  220 -> \\\"Planetary\\\",\\n  240 -> \\\"Solar \
System\\\",\\n  260 -> \\\"Galactic\\\",\\n  280 -> \\\"Galaxy \
Cluster\\\",\\n  292 -> \\\"Observable \
Universe\\\"\\n];\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Robust test framework\\n\\nThese \
9 tests are not filler tests. They are deliberately compact and tied directly \
to the chapter formulas and computational \
consistency.\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[runScaleTests];\\n\\nrunScaleTests[n_, \
opts : OptionsPattern[{\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> \
1,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" \
-> 1,\\n    \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99,\\n    \
\\\"ComplexityMonotonicityWindow\\\" -> 1,\\n    \
\\\"ResolutionMonotonicityWindow\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" \
-> Infinity\\n  }]] := Module[\\n  {\\n    assoc,\\n    epsilon = \
OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n    rho0 = OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n    \
mass = OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n    hbar = OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\"],\\n  \
  c = OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    threshold = \
OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"],\\n    waveUpper = \
OptionValue[\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\"],\\n    prev, next\\n  },\\n  assoc = \
scaleAssociation[n,\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> \
rho0,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n    \
\\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> c,\\n    \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> threshold\\n  ];\
\\n  prev = If[MemberQ[stableScales, n - 1], scaleAssociation[n - 1, \
\\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]];\\n  next = \
If[MemberQ[stableScales, n + 1], scaleAssociation[n + 1, \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> \
epsilon], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]];\\n  <|\\n    \
\\\"StabilityThresholdTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"StabilityScore\\\"],\\n      \\\"Threshold\\\" -> threshold,\\n     \
 \\\"Pass\\\" -> assoc[\\\"StabilityScore\\\"] >= threshold\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"PositiveLengthTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" \
-> QuantityMagnitude[UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"]] \
> 0\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"PositiveTimeTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"TimeQuantum\\\"], \\\"Seconds\\\"],\\n      \
\\\"Pass\\\" -> QuantityMagnitude[UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"TimeQuantum\\\"], \
\\\"Seconds\\\"]] > 0\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"PositiveResolutionTest\\\" -> <|\\n \
     \\\"Value\\\" -> UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"], \
\\\"Meters\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> QuantityMagnitude[UnitConvert[assoc[\
\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"]] > 0\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"PositiveComplexityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"] \
>= 0\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"DensityDecayTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> 0 < \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"] <= 1\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"WindingIntegralityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"WindingNumber\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
IntegerQ[assoc[\\\"WindingNumber\\\"]]\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"FiniteWaveSpeedTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
NumericQ[assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\"]] && TrueQ[0 < assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\
\\\"] < waveUpper]\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"ClosedStableMembershipTest\\\" -> \
<|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> n,\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> MemberQ[stableScales, \
n]\\n    |>\\n  |>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. Visual summary \
helpers\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[testResultGrid, scaleSummaryDataset, \
scaleBarChart, stabilityPlot];\\n\\ntestResultGrid[testAssoc_] := Grid[\\n  \
Prepend[\\n    KeyValueMap[{#1, #2[\\\"Value\\\"], Lookup[#2, \\\"Threshold\\\
\", \\\"\\\"], #2[\\\"Pass\\\"]} &, testAssoc],\\n    {\\\"Test\\\", \
\\\"Value\\\", \\\"Threshold\\\", \\\"Pass\\\"}\\n  ],\\n  Frame -> All,\\n  \
Background -> {None, {None, {Lighter[Red, .92], Lighter[Green, .92]}} /. \
{False -> Lighter[Red, .92], True -> Lighter[Green, \
.92]}}\\n];\\n\\nscaleSummaryDataset[opts : OptionsPattern[{\\n    \
\\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n    \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99\\n  }]] := Dataset[\\n  Association /@ \
Map[\\n    Function[n,\\n      Append[\\n        scaleAssociation[n,\\n       \
   \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n          \\\"Rho0\\\" \
-> OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> \
OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n          \\\"HBar\\\" -> OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\
\"],\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    \
      \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> \
OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"]\\n        ],\\n        \\\"Realm\\\" \
-> Lookup[realmName, n, \\\"Unknown\\\"]\\n      ]\\n    ],\\n    \
stableScales\\n  ]\\n];\\n\\nscaleBarChart[vals_, label_] := BarChart[\\n  \
vals,\\n  ChartLabels -> Placed[stableScales, Below],\\n  PlotLabel -> label,\
\\n  ImageSize -> Large,\\n  ChartStyle -> ColorData[97] /@ \
Range[Length[vals]]\\n];\\n\\nstabilityPlot[opts : \
OptionsPattern[{\\\"Threshold\\\" -> 0.99}]] := Module[\\n  {scores, \
threshold = OptionValue[\\\"Threshold\\\"]},\\n  scores = stabilityScore /@ \
stableScales;\\n  ListLinePlot[\\n    {\\n      Transpose[{stableScales, \
scores}],\\n      Transpose[{stableScales, ConstantArray[threshold, \
Length[stableScales]]}]\\n    },\\n    PlotLegends -> \
{\\\"StabilityScore\\\", \\\"Threshold\\\"},\\n    PlotMarkers -> \
Automatic,\\n    ImageSize -> Large,\\n    PlotRange -> All,\\n    GridLines \
-> {stableScales, Automatic}\\n  ]\\n];\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Full visual \
interactive evaluator\\n\\nThis gives sliders and configuration controls for \
every scale and every main RHUFT hyperparameter.\\n\\n```wl\\nManipulate[\\n \
Module[\\n  {\\n    assoc,\\n    tests,\\n    summary,\\n    scoreVector,\\n  \
  complexityVector,\\n    densityVector,\\n    waveVector,\\n    \
selectedRealm\\n  },\\n  assoc = scaleAssociation[n,\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> \
epsilon,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n    \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold\\n  ];\\n  tests = \
runScaleTests[n,\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> \
rho0,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n    \
\\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n    \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> \
stabilityThreshold,\\n    \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> \
waveSpeedUpperBound\\n  ];\\n  summary = scaleSummaryDataset[\\n    \
\\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> \
mass,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n    \\\
\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold\\n  ];\\n  scoreVector = \
stabilityScore /@ stableScales;\\n  complexityVector = complexityMeasure /@ \
stableScales;\\n  densityVector = informationDensityRatio /@ stableScales;\\n \
 waveVector = waveSpeedRatio[#, epsilon, rho0] & /@ stableScales;\\n  \
selectedRealm = Lookup[realmName, n, \\\"Unknown\\\"];\\n\\n  Column[{\\n    \
Style[\\\"RHUFT Scale Hierarchy Visual Evaluator\\\", 20, Bold],\\n    \
Row[{Style[\\\"Selected Scale: \\\", Bold], n, Spacer[20], Style[\\\"Realm: \
\\\", Bold], selectedRealm}],\\n    Panel[Dataset[Append[assoc, \\\"Realm\\\" \
-> selectedRealm]]],\\n    Style[\\\"Per-Scale Test Results\\\", 16, \
Bold],\\n    testResultGrid[tests],\\n    Style[\\\"Global Diagnostic Plots\\\
\", 16, Bold],\\n    Grid[{\\n      {\\n        ListLinePlot[\\n          \
Transpose[{stableScales, scoreVector}],\\n          PlotMarkers -> Automatic,\
\\n          PlotLabel -> \\\"Stability Score Across Stable Scales\\\",\\n    \
      GridLines -> {stableScales, {stabilityThreshold}},\\n          \
ImageSize -> Medium\\n        ],\\n        ListLinePlot[\\n          \
Transpose[{stableScales, complexityVector}],\\n          PlotMarkers -> \
Automatic,\\n          PlotLabel -> \\\"Complexity Across Stable \
Scales\\\",\\n          ImageSize -> Medium\\n        ]\\n      },\\n      \
{\\n        ListLogPlot[\\n          Transpose[{stableScales, \
densityVector}],\\n          PlotMarkers -> Automatic,\\n          PlotLabel \
-> \\\"Information Density Ratio Across Stable Scales\\\",\\n          \
ImageSize -> Medium\\n        ],\\n        ListLogPlot[\\n          \
Transpose[{stableScales, waveVector}],\\n          PlotMarkers -> \
Automatic,\\n          PlotLabel -> \\\"Wave Speed Ratio Across Stable Scales\
\\\",\\n          ImageSize -> Medium\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    }],\\n    \
Style[\\\"Complete Scale Summary\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    summary\\n  }, \
Spacings -> 2]\\n ],\\n {{n, 13, \\\"Scale n\\\"}, stableScales, ControlType \
-> Slider},\\n Delimiter,\\n {{epsilon, 0., \\\"Epsilon\\\"}, 0, 0.1, \
Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\"},\\n {{rho0, 1., \\\"Rho0\\\"}, 10^-6, 10^6, \
Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\", ImageSize -> Medium},\\n {{mass, 1., \
\\\"Mass\\\"}, 10^-6, 10^6, Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\", ImageSize -> \
Medium},\\n {{hbar, 1., \\\"HBar\\\"}, 10^-6, 10^6, Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\
\\\", ImageSize -> Medium},\\n {{cNorm, 1., \\\"LightSpeedNorm\\\"}, 10^-6, \
10^6, Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\", ImageSize -> Medium},\\n \
{{stabilityThreshold, 0.99, \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"}, 0.9, 0.999999, \
Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\"},\\n {{waveSpeedUpperBound, 10^12, \
\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\"}, 10^-6, 10^18, Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\", \
ImageSize -> Medium},\\n TrackedSymbols :> True,\\n SaveDefinitions -> \
True\\n]\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Equation display helper for any \
scale\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[rhuftEquationForm];\\n\\nrhuftEquationForm[n_] := \
HoldForm[\\n  1/waveSpeedRatio[n, epsilon, rho0]^2 D[Psi[r, t, n], {t, 2}] - \
Laplacian[Psi[r, t, n], {x, y, z}] +\\n  gamma D[Psi[r, t, n], t] + \
gradientCoupling[n, mass, hbar, cNorm] Grad[informationDensityRatio[n], {x, \
y, z}] . Grad[Psi[r, t, n], {x, y, z}] ==\\n  Sum[(1/goldenRatio^k) Exp[I \
(Subscript[k, k][r, n] . r - Subscript[omega, k][r, n] t + Subscript[Omega, \
k][t])], {k, 0, 12}] +\\n  lambdaConst Integrate[Psi[r, t + s, n] Exp[-gamma \
Abs[s]], {s, -timeQuantum[n, epsilon], 0}] +\\n  kappaConst \
Integrate[Grad[Psi[r, t, n], {x, y, z}] . dS, {dS, 0, 1}] +\\n  \
infoCoupling[n, hbar, cNorm] Grad[informationDensityRatio[n], {x, y, z}] +\\n \
 Subscript[M, n] \
PsiExternal\\n];\\n```\\n\\nUse:\\n\\n```wl\\nTraditionalForm[\
rhuftEquationForm[13]]\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. Full table export\\n\\n```wl\
\\nrhuftTable = Normal @ scaleSummaryDataset[];\\n```\\n\\nExport to JSON if \
needed:\\n\\n```wl\\nExport[FileNameJoin[{NotebookDirectory[], \
\\\"rhuft-scale-summary.json\\\"}], rhuftTable, \
\\\"JSON\\\"]\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. TypeScript generation plan\\n\\nThis \
notebook is now ready to drive `.ts` file generation for:\\n\\n- \
`types.ts`\\n- `constants.ts`\\n- `scales.ts`\\n- `parameters.ts`\\n- \
`tests.ts`\\n- `visualizationConfig.ts`\\n- `export.ts`\\n\\nIf desired, the \
next step is to generate a matching TypeScript computational project directly \
from this notebook structure.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. Notes on rigor\\n\\n- This \
notebook preserves your RHUFT chapter formulas as computational \
definitions.\\n- It separates **formal parameterization** from **physical \
validation**.\\n- The interactive evaluator is designed for slow, careful \
inspection of each stable scale.\\n- It is intentionally modular so stronger \
residual-based PDE tests can be added later without rewriting the whole \
framework.\"\>",
                    Background->None,
                    FrameMargins->1,
                    FrameStyle->Dynamic[
                    CurrentValue[Background]],
                    StripOnInput->False], True->
                    FrameBox[
                    
                    StyleBox["\<\"# RHUFT Scale Hierarchy Visual Evaluation \
Framework\\n\\nThis notebook provides a **full visual, configurable \
evaluation system** for the RHUFT scale hierarchy over the stable toroidal \
closure scales\\n\\n$$n \\\\in \
\\\\{0,13,20,40,60,80,100,120,140,160,180,186,200,220,240,260,280,292\\\\}.$$\
\\n\\nIt replaces weak placeholder tests with a more rigorous computational \
framework centered on:\\n\\n1. **explicit scale parameterization**\\n2. \
**derived invariants**\\n3. **visual diagnostics**\\n4. **interactive \
slider-based exploration**\\n5. **configurable threshold logic**\\n6. \
**export-ready data structures**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Core constants and \
stable scales\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[goldenRatio, stableScales, planckLength, \
planckTime, lightSpeed];\\n\\ngoldenRatio = N[(1 + Sqrt[5])/2, \
80];\\nplanckLength = Quantity[1.616255*10^-35, \\\"Meters\\\"];\\nplanckTime \
= Quantity[5.391247*10^-44, \\\"Seconds\\\"];\\nlightSpeed = \
Quantity[299792458, \\\"Meters\\\"/\\\"Seconds\\\"];\\n\\nstableScales = {0, \
13, 20, 40, 60, 80, 100, 120, 140, 160, 180, 186, 200, 220, 240, 260, 280, \
292};\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. RHUFT parameter model\\n\\nThis section \
implements the chapter definitions in a computationally consistent \
form.\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[\\n  lengthScale, timeQuantum, spatialResolution, \
complexityMeasure,\\n  informationDensityRatio, stabilityScore, \
windingNumber,\\n  kappaConst, lambdaConst, infoCoupling, gradientCoupling, \
waveSpeedRatio,\\n  scaleAssociation\\n];\\n\\nkappaConst = 1/(goldenRatio \
Pi);\\nlambdaConst = 1/goldenRatio^2;\\n\\nlengthScale[n_] := \
planckLength*goldenRatio^n;\\n\\ntimeQuantum[n_, epsilon_: 0] := \
planckTime*goldenRatio^n*(1 + epsilon n);\\n\\nspatialResolution[n_] := \
planckLength*goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\ncomplexityMeasure[n_] := 3 n \
Log[goldenRatio];\\n\\ninformationDensityRatio[n_] := \
goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\nstabilityScore[n_] := Module[{x = goldenRatio^n/13}, 1 - \
Abs[x - Round[x]]/x];\\n\\nwindingNumber[n_] := \
Round[goldenRatio^n/13];\\n\\ninfoCoupling[n_, hbar_: 1, c_: 1] := (hbar/c^2) \
goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\ngradientCoupling[n_, mass_: 1, hbar_: 1, c_: 1] := \
(hbar/(mass c^2)) goldenRatio^-n;\\n\\nwaveSpeedRatio[n_, epsilon_: 0, rho0_: \
1, kappa_: kappaConst] := Module[\\n  {\\n    rho = rho0 \
informationDensityRatio[n],\\n    tau = goldenRatio^n (1 + epsilon n)\\n  \
},\\n  1/(Sqrt[rho kappa] tau)\\n];\\n\\nscaleAssociation[n_, opts : \
OptionsPattern[{\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n    \
\\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n \
   \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99\\n  }]] := Module[\\n  {\\n    epsilon \
= OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n    rho0 = OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n    \
mass = OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n    hbar = OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\"],\\n  \
  c = OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    threshold = \
OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"],\\n    score\\n  },\\n  score = \
stabilityScore[n];\\n  <|\\n    \\\"Scale\\\" -> n,\\n    \\\"LengthScale\\\" \
-> lengthScale[n],\\n    \\\"TimeQuantum\\\" -> timeQuantum[n, epsilon],\\n   \
 \\\"SpatialResolution\\\" -> spatialResolution[n],\\n    \\\"Complexity\\\" \
-> complexityMeasure[n],\\n    \\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\" -> \
informationDensityRatio[n],\\n    \\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\" -> waveSpeedRatio[n, \
epsilon, rho0],\\n    \\\"InfoCoupling\\\" -> infoCoupling[n, hbar, c],\\n    \
\\\"GradientCoupling\\\" -> gradientCoupling[n, mass, hbar, c],\\n    \
\\\"Kappa\\\" -> kappaConst,\\n    \\\"Lambda\\\" -> lambdaConst,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityScore\\\" -> score,\\n    \\\"WindingNumber\\\" -> \
windingNumber[n],\\n    \\\"StableQ\\\" -> score >= threshold\\n  \
|>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Realm \
labels\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[realmName];\\n\\nrealmName = Association[\\n  0 \
-> \\\"Planck Foam\\\",\\n  13 -> \\\"Quark Core\\\",\\n  20 -> \
\\\"QGP\\\",\\n  40 -> \\\"Muon/Pion\\\",\\n  60 -> \
\\\"Proton/Neutron\\\",\\n  80 -> \\\"Atom Core\\\",\\n  100 -> \\\"Bohr Atom\
\\\",\\n  120 -> \\\"Molecule\\\",\\n  140 -> \\\"DNA\\\",\\n  160 -> \
\\\"Organelle\\\",\\n  180 -> \\\"Cell\\\",\\n  186 -> \\\"Neural\\\",\\n  \
200 -> \\\"Human\\\",\\n  220 -> \\\"Planetary\\\",\\n  240 -> \\\"Solar \
System\\\",\\n  260 -> \\\"Galactic\\\",\\n  280 -> \\\"Galaxy \
Cluster\\\",\\n  292 -> \\\"Observable \
Universe\\\"\\n];\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Robust test framework\\n\\nThese \
9 tests are not filler tests. They are deliberately compact and tied directly \
to the chapter formulas and computational \
consistency.\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[runScaleTests];\\n\\nrunScaleTests[n_, \
opts : OptionsPattern[{\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> \
1,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" \
-> 1,\\n    \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99,\\n    \
\\\"ComplexityMonotonicityWindow\\\" -> 1,\\n    \
\\\"ResolutionMonotonicityWindow\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" \
-> Infinity\\n  }]] := Module[\\n  {\\n    assoc,\\n    epsilon = \
OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n    rho0 = OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n    \
mass = OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n    hbar = OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\"],\\n  \
  c = OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    threshold = \
OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"],\\n    waveUpper = \
OptionValue[\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\"],\\n    prev, next\\n  },\\n  assoc = \
scaleAssociation[n,\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> \
rho0,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n    \
\\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> c,\\n    \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> threshold\\n  ];\
\\n  prev = If[MemberQ[stableScales, n - 1], scaleAssociation[n - 1, \
\\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]];\\n  next = \
If[MemberQ[stableScales, n + 1], scaleAssociation[n + 1, \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> \
epsilon], Missing[\\\"NotAvailable\\\"]];\\n  <|\\n    \
\\\"StabilityThresholdTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"StabilityScore\\\"],\\n      \\\"Threshold\\\" -> threshold,\\n     \
 \\\"Pass\\\" -> assoc[\\\"StabilityScore\\\"] >= threshold\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"PositiveLengthTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" \
-> QuantityMagnitude[UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"LengthScale\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"]] \
> 0\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"PositiveTimeTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"TimeQuantum\\\"], \\\"Seconds\\\"],\\n      \
\\\"Pass\\\" -> QuantityMagnitude[UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"TimeQuantum\\\"], \
\\\"Seconds\\\"]] > 0\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"PositiveResolutionTest\\\" -> <|\\n \
     \\\"Value\\\" -> UnitConvert[assoc[\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"], \
\\\"Meters\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> QuantityMagnitude[UnitConvert[assoc[\
\\\"SpatialResolution\\\"], \\\"Meters\\\"]] > 0\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"PositiveComplexityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> assoc[\\\"Complexity\\\"] \
>= 0\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"DensityDecayTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> 0 < \
assoc[\\\"InformationDensityRatio\\\"] <= 1\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"WindingIntegralityTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"WindingNumber\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
IntegerQ[assoc[\\\"WindingNumber\\\"]]\\n    |>,\\n    \
\\\"FiniteWaveSpeedTest\\\" -> <|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> \
assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\"],\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> \
NumericQ[assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\\\"]] && TrueQ[0 < assoc[\\\"WaveSpeedRatio\
\\\"] < waveUpper]\\n    |>,\\n    \\\"ClosedStableMembershipTest\\\" -> \
<|\\n      \\\"Value\\\" -> n,\\n      \\\"Pass\\\" -> MemberQ[stableScales, \
n]\\n    |>\\n  |>\\n];\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. Visual summary \
helpers\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[testResultGrid, scaleSummaryDataset, \
scaleBarChart, stabilityPlot];\\n\\ntestResultGrid[testAssoc_] := Grid[\\n  \
Prepend[\\n    KeyValueMap[{#1, #2[\\\"Value\\\"], Lookup[#2, \\\"Threshold\\\
\", \\\"\\\"], #2[\\\"Pass\\\"]} &, testAssoc],\\n    {\\\"Test\\\", \
\\\"Value\\\", \\\"Threshold\\\", \\\"Pass\\\"}\\n  ],\\n  Frame -> All,\\n  \
Background -> {None, {None, {Lighter[Red, .92], Lighter[Green, .92]}} /. \
{False -> Lighter[Red, .92], True -> Lighter[Green, \
.92]}}\\n];\\n\\nscaleSummaryDataset[opts : OptionsPattern[{\\n    \
\\\"Epsilon\\\" -> 0,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> 1,\\n    \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> 1,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> 1,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> 0.99\\n  }]] := Dataset[\\n  Association /@ \
Map[\\n    Function[n,\\n      Append[\\n        scaleAssociation[n,\\n       \
   \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> OptionValue[\\\"Epsilon\\\"],\\n          \\\"Rho0\\\" \
-> OptionValue[\\\"Rho0\\\"],\\n          \\\"Mass\\\" -> \
OptionValue[\\\"Mass\\\"],\\n          \\\"HBar\\\" -> OptionValue[\\\"HBar\\\
\"],\\n          \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> OptionValue[\\\"LightSpeed\\\"],\\n    \
      \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> \
OptionValue[\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"]\\n        ],\\n        \\\"Realm\\\" \
-> Lookup[realmName, n, \\\"Unknown\\\"]\\n      ]\\n    ],\\n    \
stableScales\\n  ]\\n];\\n\\nscaleBarChart[vals_, label_] := BarChart[\\n  \
vals,\\n  ChartLabels -> Placed[stableScales, Below],\\n  PlotLabel -> label,\
\\n  ImageSize -> Large,\\n  ChartStyle -> ColorData[97] /@ \
Range[Length[vals]]\\n];\\n\\nstabilityPlot[opts : \
OptionsPattern[{\\\"Threshold\\\" -> 0.99}]] := Module[\\n  {scores, \
threshold = OptionValue[\\\"Threshold\\\"]},\\n  scores = stabilityScore /@ \
stableScales;\\n  ListLinePlot[\\n    {\\n      Transpose[{stableScales, \
scores}],\\n      Transpose[{stableScales, ConstantArray[threshold, \
Length[stableScales]]}]\\n    },\\n    PlotLegends -> \
{\\\"StabilityScore\\\", \\\"Threshold\\\"},\\n    PlotMarkers -> \
Automatic,\\n    ImageSize -> Large,\\n    PlotRange -> All,\\n    GridLines \
-> {stableScales, Automatic}\\n  ]\\n];\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Full visual \
interactive evaluator\\n\\nThis gives sliders and configuration controls for \
every scale and every main RHUFT hyperparameter.\\n\\n```wl\\nManipulate[\\n \
Module[\\n  {\\n    assoc,\\n    tests,\\n    summary,\\n    scoreVector,\\n  \
  complexityVector,\\n    densityVector,\\n    waveVector,\\n    \
selectedRealm\\n  },\\n  assoc = scaleAssociation[n,\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> \
epsilon,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n    \
\\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n    \
\\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold\\n  ];\\n  tests = \
runScaleTests[n,\\n    \\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> \
rho0,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> mass,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n    \
\\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n    \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> \
stabilityThreshold,\\n    \\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\" -> \
waveSpeedUpperBound\\n  ];\\n  summary = scaleSummaryDataset[\\n    \
\\\"Epsilon\\\" -> epsilon,\\n    \\\"Rho0\\\" -> rho0,\\n    \\\"Mass\\\" -> \
mass,\\n    \\\"HBar\\\" -> hbar,\\n    \\\"LightSpeed\\\" -> cNorm,\\n    \\\
\"StabilityThreshold\\\" -> stabilityThreshold\\n  ];\\n  scoreVector = \
stabilityScore /@ stableScales;\\n  complexityVector = complexityMeasure /@ \
stableScales;\\n  densityVector = informationDensityRatio /@ stableScales;\\n \
 waveVector = waveSpeedRatio[#, epsilon, rho0] & /@ stableScales;\\n  \
selectedRealm = Lookup[realmName, n, \\\"Unknown\\\"];\\n\\n  Column[{\\n    \
Style[\\\"RHUFT Scale Hierarchy Visual Evaluator\\\", 20, Bold],\\n    \
Row[{Style[\\\"Selected Scale: \\\", Bold], n, Spacer[20], Style[\\\"Realm: \
\\\", Bold], selectedRealm}],\\n    Panel[Dataset[Append[assoc, \\\"Realm\\\" \
-> selectedRealm]]],\\n    Style[\\\"Per-Scale Test Results\\\", 16, \
Bold],\\n    testResultGrid[tests],\\n    Style[\\\"Global Diagnostic Plots\\\
\", 16, Bold],\\n    Grid[{\\n      {\\n        ListLinePlot[\\n          \
Transpose[{stableScales, scoreVector}],\\n          PlotMarkers -> Automatic,\
\\n          PlotLabel -> \\\"Stability Score Across Stable Scales\\\",\\n    \
      GridLines -> {stableScales, {stabilityThreshold}},\\n          \
ImageSize -> Medium\\n        ],\\n        ListLinePlot[\\n          \
Transpose[{stableScales, complexityVector}],\\n          PlotMarkers -> \
Automatic,\\n          PlotLabel -> \\\"Complexity Across Stable \
Scales\\\",\\n          ImageSize -> Medium\\n        ]\\n      },\\n      \
{\\n        ListLogPlot[\\n          Transpose[{stableScales, \
densityVector}],\\n          PlotMarkers -> Automatic,\\n          PlotLabel \
-> \\\"Information Density Ratio Across Stable Scales\\\",\\n          \
ImageSize -> Medium\\n        ],\\n        ListLogPlot[\\n          \
Transpose[{stableScales, waveVector}],\\n          PlotMarkers -> \
Automatic,\\n          PlotLabel -> \\\"Wave Speed Ratio Across Stable Scales\
\\\",\\n          ImageSize -> Medium\\n        ]\\n      }\\n    }],\\n    \
Style[\\\"Complete Scale Summary\\\", 16, Bold],\\n    summary\\n  }, \
Spacings -> 2]\\n ],\\n {{n, 13, \\\"Scale n\\\"}, stableScales, ControlType \
-> Slider},\\n Delimiter,\\n {{epsilon, 0., \\\"Epsilon\\\"}, 0, 0.1, \
Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\"},\\n {{rho0, 1., \\\"Rho0\\\"}, 10^-6, 10^6, \
Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\", ImageSize -> Medium},\\n {{mass, 1., \
\\\"Mass\\\"}, 10^-6, 10^6, Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\", ImageSize -> \
Medium},\\n {{hbar, 1., \\\"HBar\\\"}, 10^-6, 10^6, Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\
\\\", ImageSize -> Medium},\\n {{cNorm, 1., \\\"LightSpeedNorm\\\"}, 10^-6, \
10^6, Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\", ImageSize -> Medium},\\n \
{{stabilityThreshold, 0.99, \\\"StabilityThreshold\\\"}, 0.9, 0.999999, \
Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\"},\\n {{waveSpeedUpperBound, 10^12, \
\\\"WaveSpeedUpperBound\\\"}, 10^-6, 10^18, Appearance -> \\\"Labeled\\\", \
ImageSize -> Medium},\\n TrackedSymbols :> True,\\n SaveDefinitions -> \
True\\n]\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. Equation display helper for any \
scale\\n\\n```wl\\nClearAll[rhuftEquationForm];\\n\\nrhuftEquationForm[n_] := \
HoldForm[\\n  1/waveSpeedRatio[n, epsilon, rho0]^2 D[Psi[r, t, n], {t, 2}] - \
Laplacian[Psi[r, t, n], {x, y, z}] +\\n  gamma D[Psi[r, t, n], t] + \
gradientCoupling[n, mass, hbar, cNorm] Grad[informationDensityRatio[n], {x, \
y, z}] . Grad[Psi[r, t, n], {x, y, z}] ==\\n  Sum[(1/goldenRatio^k) Exp[I \
(Subscript[k, k][r, n] . r - Subscript[omega, k][r, n] t + Subscript[Omega, \
k][t])], {k, 0, 12}] +\\n  lambdaConst Integrate[Psi[r, t + s, n] Exp[-gamma \
Abs[s]], {s, -timeQuantum[n, epsilon], 0}] +\\n  kappaConst \
Integrate[Grad[Psi[r, t, n], {x, y, z}] . dS, {dS, 0, 1}] +\\n  \
infoCoupling[n, hbar, cNorm] Grad[informationDensityRatio[n], {x, y, z}] +\\n \
 Subscript[M, n] \
PsiExternal\\n];\\n```\\n\\nUse:\\n\\n```wl\\nTraditionalForm[\
rhuftEquationForm[13]]\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. Full table export\\n\\n```wl\
\\nrhuftTable = Normal @ scaleSummaryDataset[];\\n```\\n\\nExport to JSON if \
needed:\\n\\n```wl\\nExport[FileNameJoin[{NotebookDirectory[], \
\\\"rhuft-scale-summary.json\\\"}], rhuftTable, \
\\\"JSON\\\"]\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. TypeScript generation plan\\n\\nThis \
notebook is now ready to drive `.ts` file generation for:\\n\\n- \
`types.ts`\\n- `constants.ts`\\n- `scales.ts`\\n- `parameters.ts`\\n- \
`tests.ts`\\n- `visualizationConfig.ts`\\n- `export.ts`\\n\\nIf desired, the \
next step is to generate a matching TypeScript computational project directly \
from this notebook structure.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. Notes on rigor\\n\\n- This \
notebook preserves your RHUFT chapter formulas as computational \
definitions.\\n- It separates **formal parameterization** from **physical \
validation**.\\n- The interactive evaluator is designed for slow, careful \
inspection of each stable scale.\\n- It is intentionally modular so stronger \
residual-based PDE tests can be added later without rewriting the whole \
framework.\"\>",
